sequenceDiagram
accTitle: Copying feedback with a recovery path
accDescr: The reviewer asks the page to copy feedback. If clipboard access fails, the page offers a download. No direct agent submission occurs.
participant Reviewer
participant Page
participant Clipboard
Reviewer->>Page: Copy feedback
Page->>Clipboard: Write response
alt Clipboard available
Clipboard-->>Page: Copied
Page-->>Reviewer: Paste into conversation
else Clipboard denied
Clipboard-->>Page: Denied
Page-->>Reviewer: Offer download
end
